.sp 1
Turn units on or off in the \fB[Units]\fR section of \fBkome.\&conf\fR(5).\&
.PP
When kome changes the icons it refreshes Plasma'\&s panel, which otherwise
keeps old icons until hovered; \fBRefreshPanel=off\fR in \fBkome.\&conf\fR(5) turns
that into a hint.\&
.PP
