.SH FILES
.PP
\fI~/.\&config/kome/kome.\&conf\fR
.RS 4
Settings, see \fBkome.\&conf\fR(5).\&
.PP
.RE
\fI~/.\&config/kome/{presets,palettes,styles,templates}/\fR
.RS 4
Your own files; they override shipped ones with the same name.\&
.PP
.RE
\fI~/.\&local/share/kome/snapshots/\fR
.RS 4
The \fBoriginal\fR and \fBprevious\fR snapshots.\&
.PP
.RE
\fI~/.\&local/state/kome/\fR
.RS 4
The active preset, the manifest of what kome created, and the lock.\&
.PP
.RE
All of them follow \fBXDG_CONFIG_HOME\fR, \fBXDG_DATA_HOME\fR and \fBXDG_STATE_HOME\fR.\&
.PP
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Try a look, then go back:
.PP
.RS 4
kome apply mocha
.br
kome restore original
.PP
.RE
See what a preset needs and install it:
.PP
.RS 4
kome deps mocha
.PP
.RE
Give a terminal kome'\&s colours:
.PP
.RS 4
kome doctor --fix
.PP
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBkome.\&conf\fR(5), \fBplasma-apply-colorscheme\fR(1)
.PP
